@startuml F2.1-D02-download-diploma
title F2.1-D02 — Download do diploma
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Egresso" as Egresso
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AlumniController" as Ctrl
participant "DiplomaDownloadUC" as UC
participant "MinIO" as MinIO

Egresso -> WebApp: Download diploma
WebApp -> Ctrl: pede URL
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> MinIO: URL GET\npresigned 15 min
MinIO --> UC: URL
UC --> Ctrl: URL
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp -> MinIO: GET PDF
MinIO --> Egresso: download

note right of UC
  Não regenera nem reassina
  Arquivo oficial da secretaria
end note

@enduml
